		{
			dependencies: ["4402587B0EAC4EEC"]
			description: [
				"The Event Horizon Antimatter Synthesizer is a powerful alternative to produce Mekanism Antimatter. It is recommended to use multiple Synthesizers together with a Naquadah Reactor (see the &eMekanism&r chapter)."
				"JEI shows all replacement recipes under the uses of the Controller."
				""
				"&eController:&r a &6Supreme Purifying Factory&r (Mekanism Extras) and an &6Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer&r (Mekanism), plus the usual 2 Redstone Servos, 2 Redstone Reception Coils, 2 Cobalt Blocks and a Manasteel Ingot."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&eStructure:&r every block is listed as a task. Check the structure preview in JEI (uses of the Controller) or let a &eMultiblock Builder&r place it for you."
				""
				"&ePorts:&r a recipe only starts if its inputs and outputs fit in the ports, so these are the sizes that run every recipe:"
				"- 2x Fluid Input: &eSmall&r or bigger"
				"- 2x Fluid Output: &eSmall&r or bigger"
				""
				"The Gigantic Energy and Colossal Gas ports are fixed parts of the structure and are listed as tasks."
			]
			id: "363152D3E6DCCBA7"
