		{
			dependencies: ["4402587B0EAC4EEC"]
			description: [
				"The Fire Attuned Machine offers a few high temperature recipes:"
				"- Bulk Lava from Cobblestone"
				"- Life Essence from &aTerrasteel&r (skips the Blood Altar grind)"
				"- Late game fluids: &dEther Gas&r, &dLiquid Sculk Matter&r, &dLiquid Dragon Breath&r, &dQuantum Infusion Source&r"
				""
				"&eController:&r a &6Celestigem&r (Just Dire Things, quested in the &eAllTheModium&r chapter) and a &6Nitro Crystal&r (&ePowah&r, needs a Nether Star), plus the usual 2 Redstone Servos, 2 Redstone Reception Coils, 2 Cobalt Blocks and a Manasteel Ingot."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&eFire Attuned Machine Tier 1 structure:&r every block is listed as a task. Check the structure preview in JEI (uses of the Controller) or let a &eMultiblock Builder&r place it for you."
				""
				"&ePorts:&r a recipe only starts if its inputs and outputs fit in the ports. These sizes run most recipes; the few that need bigger ports are named:"
				"- 1x Energy Input: &eBig&r or bigger &7(up to &eGigantic&7 for: Ether Gas, Energized Crystal Dust)&r"
				"- 1x Item Output: &eSmall&r or bigger &7(Tiny runs 1 of 2 recipes)&r"
				"- 1x Item Input: &eSmall&r or bigger &7(Tiny runs 4 of 9 recipes)&r"
				"- 1x Fluid Input: &eSmall&r or bigger"
				"- 1x Fluid Output: &eSmall&r or bigger"
				""
				"Higher tiers are optional upgrades, see the quests further out."
			]
