		{
			dependencies: ["3F6F01364D47157D"]
			description: [
				"Upgrades the Fire Attuned Machine from Tier 1 to Tier 2."
				""
				"&eSwap:&r take out 1x Factory Blue Framed Circuit and put the blocks from the tasks in their place."
				""
				"&ePorts:&r this tier needs bigger ports to run all its recipes:"
				"- 1x Energy Input: &eGigantic&r &7(Enormous runs 8 of 11 recipes)&r"
				"- 1x Item Output: &eGigantic&r or bigger &7(Enormous runs 2 of 3 recipes)&r"
				"- 1x Item Input: &eBig&r or bigger &7(Normal runs 10 of 11 recipes)&r"
				""
				"Tier 2 runs much bigger batches (about 5-10x per craft), runs faster and unlocks &dLiquid Malic Acid&r from apples."
				"A Tier 2 build only runs Tier 2 recipes, so make sure your inputs and power can keep up."
				""
				"Check the structure preview in JEI (uses of the Controller) for the exact layout."
			]
